# Copy to `.env.local` and adjust. Vite only exposes variables prefixed VITE_.

# Console verbosity in dev: debug | info | warn | error (default: debug).
VITE_LOG_LEVEL=debug

# Bird identification service (mask type "identify"). Unset, the app calls
# /api/birds/predict, which the dev server proxies to the service (see the
# `server.proxy` block in vite.config.ts) — that is what avoids CORS. Set this
# to an absolute URL only if the service answers with CORS headers itself.
# VITE_BIRD_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/v1/predict

# Where the dev-server proxy forwards those calls. Read by vite.config.ts (no
# VITE_ prefix: it is used by the server, never shipped to the browser).
# BIRD_API_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:5000
